Evacuate & Isolate: Immediately clear the affected zone (minimum 30-meter radius). Establish hot, warm, and cold safety
zones.
Containment: Deploy absorbent booms, neutralizers, or sandbags to block storm drains and surface water pathways.
PPE Deployment: Responders must equip Level B/A PPE prior to entering the warm/hot zone.
